data: {"id": "e35863071ba545e7-thinking-parallel_evidence-2032", "run_id": "e35863071ba545e7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 调查结论\n\n### 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w`\n- **UID**: `e798824d-dd3f-4414-bcc1-fa96560da3f1`\n- **节点**: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- **控制关系**: Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workload-5b5fc86c8c` → Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w`\n- **容器**: `app` (镜像: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)\n- **标签**: `aiops.lab/case-id=c03`\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**: `Pending` / `ContainerCreating`（0/1 Ready，未分配 IP 地址 `<none>`）\n2. **根因事件**: \n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1788416573404, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

